{
  "name": "dsh-chat-image-lightbox",
  "description": "对话里的图值得被认真看：点一下全屏灯箱（缩放/拖拽平移/下载另存/左右翻页），一键把会话内的图收成可调列数的缩略图网格，或整块隐藏（不留空白）；本地图 TIFF/HEIC 自动无损转码，网图被防盗链拦截时自动转存本地显示；并内置「图片投递铁律」——强制图片写进回复正文而不是只躺在折叠的工具行里，避免用户误以为没发图。| Chat images get a proper look: full-screen lightbox (zoom / drag pan / download / prev-next), a conversation-wide thumbnail grid with adjustable columns, hide/show without leaving blank space, lossless TIFF/HEIC transcoding, and automatic local fallback for hotlink-protected images — plus a resident delivery rule that forces every image into the reply body instead of a collapsed tool row, so nobody ever wonders whether an image was actually sent.",
  "version": "1.8.1",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/images/lightbox.png",
    "docs/images/columns-3col.png",
    "docs/images/columns-multi.png",
    "docs/images/hide-images.png",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README-zh.md",
    "README-es.md",
    "README-pt.md",
    "README-hi.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "image",
    "lightbox",
    "gallery",
    "thumbnail",
    "tiff",
    "download",
    "image-delivery",
    "inline-image",
    "dsh-image",
    "screenshot",
    "webp",
    "heic"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox#readme",
  "dependencies": {
    "sharp": "^0.35.3"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.7.0"
}
